cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it. If you use a datapack, cite the
  underlying source as well -- the coefficients belong to those authors.
title: "openimcc: ideal mixing of complex components for silicate melts"
abstract: >-
  An open implementation of the ideal-mixing-of-complex-components (IMCC) model
  for silicate melt speciation, returning parent-oxide activities, activity
  coefficients and degree of association. Ships auditable datapacks with
  per-row provenance and an empirical benchmark harness that reports refusals
  as data.
type: software
authors:
